{"v":4,"catch":"客製化你的攻擊來面對各種謎團！","desc":"250年前，被稱為\"Umbrakhs\"的人類被地底人強行遷移到稱為「Pangaea」的軌道空間移住。\n\n\n身為Elysium帝國的第二王子，同時也是電子實體化植入物 \"Nosferatu \"的使用者ー\"Regal\"、\n受到Pangaea危機影響，被困在惑星Tatenia上的你必須在已成為廢墟的首都Tartarus周圍挑戰各種危險並想辦法生存下來進而解開Umbrakhs之謎。\n\n・快節奏的對敵戰鬥。\n・廣闊多樣的區域讓您來探索，對了，記得要避開危險。\n・從16種不同的攻擊方式中來客製自己獨創的Combo。\n・享受豐富的故事情節，揭開Umbrakhs的神秘面紗。\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2023-11-09","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f2d6e1de8a6529bb0be5f379f7bd1eeab76e4ad1bfbf80bafc97c6eb55cd56f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/105310917cc360dbb5fc6559662103a3c56f8035c72eee5e6fb91ec47ecc1c29.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4cc3646e5231759973dd024ab17de80a2bc7b19b13cabd678eca7b7dd9d2b6c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de7681221c6cb5cdbe66c5474787a6b447e4875cf9a1161ca604a5fef63b78e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/06c4940d634eb091f642348e1fb698dfe726de121ff445f78de15b4625beecf8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4db005f2d90a38593add06d7366357f1cf211d075141de056a4000ec7102c3de.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e3701b536000","dlc":[]}